## License and third-party notices

cinterp is MIT licensed; see `LICENSE`. `cinterp-cc` embeds an external-symbol
index generated at build time from data bundled with Zig:

- MinGW-w64 `.def` export lists — ZPL-2.1, Copyright (c) 2009-2013 the mingw-w64 project
- glibc `abilists` symbol/version tables — LGPL-2.1-or-later, Copyright (C) Free Software Foundation, Inc.

Only factual symbol names, library names and calling conventions are
reproduced; no upstream source code is copied. The full attribution is in
`THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md` and every package above is recorded in
`SBOM.spdx.json`.
<!-- /compiler-only -->

